<title>SPAIN: S&amp;P takes Spain's Endesa off ratings watch.</title>
<headline>S&amp;P takes Spain's Endesa off ratings watch.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-11-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ratings agency Standard &amp; Poor's confirmed on Thursday the ratings for Spanish electricity firm Endesa, adding that it had removed it from its ratings watch.</p>
<p>It confirmed its AA+ ratings on senior peseta long-term debt and its AA rating on senior foreign currency long-term debt.</p>
</text>
